# コードアーキテクチャ

## 環境クラス階層 (legged_gym/legged_gym/envs/)

```
LeggedRobot (base/legged_robot.py)
  └── Humanoid (base/humanoid.py)
        └── HumanoidChar (base/humanoid_char.py)
              └── HumanoidMimic (base/humanoid_mimic.py)
                    ├── G1Mimic (g1/g1_mimic.py)
                    └── G1MimicDistill (g1/g1_mimic_distill.py)
                          └── G1MimicFuture (g1/g1_mimic_future.py)
```

## 設定クラス階層 (Config)

```
LeggedRobotCfg → HumanoidCharCfg → HumanoidMimicCfg
  ├── G1MimicCfg (29DOF, PPO学習用)
  ├── G1MimicPrivCfg (29DOF, Teacher Policy)
  │     ├── G1MimicStuCfg (29DOF, Student Distill)
  │     └── G1MimicStuFutureCfg (29DOF, Student Future)
  └── G1_23DOF_MimicPrivCfg (23DOF, Teacher Policy)
        └── G1_23DOF_MimicStuFutureCfg (23DOF, Student Future)
```

## タスクレジストリ (legged_gym/legged_gym/envs/__init__.py)

登録されているタスク:
| タスク名 | 環境クラス | 設定 | 用途 |
|---|---|---|---|
| `g1_mimic` | G1Mimic | G1MimicCfg | 29DOF PPO単体学習 |
| `g1_priv_mimic` | G1MimicDistill | G1MimicPrivCfg | 29DOF Teacher |
| `g1_stu_mimic` | G1MimicDistill | G1MimicStuCfg | 29DOF Student (DAgger) |
| `g1_stu_future` | G1MimicFuture | G1MimicStuFutureCfg | 29DOF Student+Future |
| `g1_23dof_priv` | G1MimicDistill | G1_23DOF_MimicPrivCfg | 23DOF Teacher |
| `g1_23dof_future` | G1MimicFuture | G1_23DOF_MimicStuFutureCfg | 23DOF Student+Future |

## RL アルゴリズム (rsl_rl/)

| クラス | 説明 |
|---|---|
| `OnPolicyRunnerMimic` | PPO学習ループ (Teacher用) |
| `OnPolicyDaggerRunner` | DAgger+PPO学習ループ (Student用) |
| `DAggerRunner` | 純粋DAgger蒸留ランナー |
| `ActorCriticMimic` | Teacher用 Actor-Critic |
| `ActorCriticFuture` | Student Future用 Actor-Critic (MoE) |
| `DAggerActor` | 純粋DAgger Student Actor |

## 観測空間の構造

### Teacher (Privileged) Observation
```
priv_obs = [priv_mimic_obs | proprio_obs | priv_info]

priv_mimic_obs: 20ステップ × (21 + num_dof + 3×9) per step
proprio_obs:    ang_vel(3) + imu(2) + dof_pos(N) + dof_vel(N) + last_action(N)
priv_info:      base_lin_vel(3) + root_pos(3) + root_rot(4) + key_body_pos(9×3) + ...
```

### Student Observation
```
obs = [mimic_obs | proprio_obs] × (history_len + 1) + future_obs

mimic_obs:    root_vel_xy(2) + root_pos_z(1) + roll_pitch(2) + yaw_ang_vel(1) + dof_pos(N)
proprio_obs:  ang_vel(3) + imu(2) + dof_pos(N) + dof_vel(N) + last_action(N)
future_obs:   同 mimic_obs × num_future_steps
```

## デプロイ構造 (deploy_real/)

- **Redis** でモーションサーバとコントローラ間通信
  - `state_body_unitree_g1` / `state_body_unitree_g1_23dof`: ロボット状態
  - `action_body_unitree_g1` / `action_body_unitree_g1_23dof`: ミミックObservation
- **server_low_level_g1_sim.py**: MuJoCo sim2sim (29DOF)
- **server_low_level_g1_23dof_sim.py**: MuJoCo sim2sim (23DOF)
- **server_low_level_g1_real.py**: 実機制御 (Unitree SDK)
- **server_motion_lib.py**: モーション再生サーバ

## 重要なパス定数
- `LEGGED_GYM_ROOT_DIR`: `legged_gym/legged_gym/` (legged_gym/__init__.py で定義)
- `LEGGED_GYM_ENVS_DIR`: `legged_gym/legged_gym/legged_gym/envs/`
- ログ出力先: `legged_gym/legged_gym/logs/<proj_name>/<exptid>/`
- モーションデータ設定: `legged_gym/motion_data_configs/*.yaml`
